sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Citizen
    actor Lawyer as Lawyer
    participant UI as WhatsApp / Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant LLM as Claude Sonnet
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant NOTIFY as Notification Service
    participant PAY as Razorpay

    User->>UI: I need a lawyer for this
    UI->>API: POST /api/lawyer/connect

    API->>LLM: Generate structured case brief
    LLM-->>API: Case type facts laws documents urgency location

    API->>DB: Query verified lawyers by domain city rating
    DB-->>API: Matched lawyers ranked

    API->>UI: Show top 3 lawyer profiles
    UI->>User: Lawyer cards with details

    User->>UI: Selects Advocate Sharma
    UI->>API: POST /api/lawyer/refer

    API->>DB: Create referral record status pending

    API->>NOTIFY: Send referral to lawyer
    NOTIFY->>Lawyer: New referral - Tenant dispute in Delhi

    Lawyer->>API: GET /api/lawyer/referral/id
    API-->>Lawyer: Full case brief + documents

    alt Lawyer accepts
        Lawyer->>API: POST /api/lawyer/referral/id/accept
        API->>DB: Update referral status accepted
        API->>NOTIFY: Notify citizen
        NOTIFY->>User: Advocate Sharma accepted
        API->>PAY: Charge lawyer referral fee Rs 500-2500
        PAY-->>API: Payment confirmed
    else Lawyer declines
        Lawyer->>API: POST /api/lawyer/referral/id/decline
        API->>DB: Update status declined
        API->>API: Auto-refer to next lawyer
    end

    User->>API: POST /api/lawyer/rate rating 4.5
    API->>DB: Update lawyer rating
